WEBVTT

00:00:10.670 --> 00:00:13.840
Your eye exam took two hours.

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:16.910
What will you report?

00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:18.810
What the doctor said.

00:00:30.390 --> 00:00:32.790
Almost done, Miss Robin.

00:00:34.060 --> 00:00:35.120
Thanks.

00:00:36.970 --> 00:00:38.760
You're still not convinced?

00:00:39.470 --> 00:00:44.910
It just feels strange that there are things I don't know about my own body.

00:00:45.610 --> 00:00:46.640
What's that?

00:00:46.640 --> 00:00:48.080
I used to ride it in Italy.

00:00:48.850 --> 00:00:50.310
It finally got here.

00:00:52.550 --> 00:00:56.920
Your eyesight temporarily worsens when you use your ability at full power.

00:00:57.420 --> 00:00:59.260
Aren't you satisfied with that explanation?

00:00:59.260 --> 00:01:02.280
But they weren't able to measure it.

00:01:02.660 --> 00:01:04.960
Are you going to stop using your glasses, then?

00:01:06.560 --> 00:01:07.830
I'll use them.

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:08.990
Of course you will.

00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:12.290
If you can't control your powers, they're too dangerous for you to use.

00:01:12.970 --> 00:01:17.930
Oh, so does this means you'll start treating me as your partner now?

00:01:19.040 --> 00:01:23.640
I'll have you do what needs to be done whether or not you're my partner.

00:01:24.380 --> 00:01:26.250
What's your power, Amon?

00:01:26.680 --> 00:01:29.080
It seems like you always use a gun...

00:01:31.420 --> 00:01:34.050
Oh, or maybe they haven't woken yet.

00:01:35.320 --> 00:01:37.220
I'm under no obligation to answer you.

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:49.570
All done, Miss Robin.

00:02:01.750 --> 00:02:04.600
I feel like it'll disappear...

00:02:04.430 --> 00:02:10.330
...the instant I look away.

00:02:12.680 --> 00:02:15.470
I just kept counting...

00:02:15.370 --> 00:02:20.910
...all the many traces of loneliness...

00:02:20.870 --> 00:02:28.280
...that I'd vomited up.

00:02:28.340 --> 00:02:34.220
In this time that seems so dry,

00:02:34.160 --> 00:02:39.330
...my heart is thrashing around and drowning.

00:02:39.260 --> 00:02:45.190
It takes those lies that make my head spin...

00:02:45.100 --> 00:02:48.240
...and tears them to pieces.

00:02:48.070 --> 00:02:57.910
 And the place I lose my way in...

00:03:00.440 --> 00:03:05.740
...is a dim, hazy world.

00:03:44.950 --> 00:03:45.920
W-Who are you?!

00:03:46.320 --> 00:03:48.790
Hey, Robin, what are you doing?

00:03:48.790 --> 00:03:50.390
I was just looking.

00:03:49.530 --> 00:03:50.590
Who are you people?

00:03:50.390 --> 00:03:52.080
It's rude to stare.

00:03:52.800 --> 00:03:54.300
I just thought it was unusual...

00:03:54.300 --> 00:03:55.360
Uh, hello?

00:03:55.360 --> 00:03:59.100
We're not here to play around. Focus on the job at hand.

00:04:00.770 --> 00:04:01.760
Um...

00:04:02.440 --> 00:04:04.130
Oh, I'm sorry about that.

00:04:04.770 --> 00:04:07.330
Have you seen this man around here?

00:04:11.550 --> 00:04:14.380
Is he really going to be in a place like this?

00:04:18.550 --> 00:04:23.650
Is our missing witch really gonna be in a place like this?

00:04:23.990 --> 00:04:27.020
If he is, it'll be like finding a needle in a haystack.

00:04:32.740 --> 00:04:34.970
Shouji Takizawa, age 46.

00:04:35.740 --> 00:04:39.200
He had an expensive house and worked in a first-rate brokerage firm,

00:04:39.810 --> 00:04:41.610
...but he suddenly disappeared.

00:04:41.980 --> 00:04:44.670
There are lots of reasons why he would disappear.

00:04:45.010 --> 00:04:48.780
If he wasn't on the witches' descendants list.

00:04:49.190 --> 00:04:50.580
You never know.

00:04:50.990 --> 00:04:53.550
Maybe he's just a witch who was embezzling company funds,

00:04:54.290 --> 00:04:56.420
or a witch who was caught having an affair.

00:04:57.030 --> 00:05:01.330
Besides, maybe he's staying in a hotel, not someplace like this.

00:05:01.530 --> 00:05:05.060
When he disappeared, he didn't take any money or credit cards with him.

00:05:05.700 --> 00:05:10.760
There aren't many ways to live without money in this town.

00:05:12.210 --> 00:05:14.440
Still, this is boring work.

00:05:15.340 --> 00:05:17.510
Hey, mister, do you have a minute?

00:05:17.510 --> 00:05:18.910
What do you two want?

00:05:19.680 --> 00:05:22.050
Have you had any newcomers lately?

00:05:22.590 --> 00:05:23.980
Are you cops?

00:05:24.250 --> 00:05:27.250
No, no... We're just looking for someone.

00:05:28.890 --> 00:05:30.260
What's this?

00:05:33.860 --> 00:05:35.020
What's what?

00:05:42.970 --> 00:05:44.230
Pictures?

00:05:45.370 --> 00:05:47.840
What's that smell?

00:05:48.340 --> 00:05:49.310
Smell?

00:05:59.360 --> 00:06:01.590
Hey, are you okay, mister?

00:06:19.410 --> 00:06:20.200
Hey!

00:06:36.560 --> 00:06:38.860
All right, I understand.

00:06:42.600 --> 00:06:44.460
The lab results are in.

00:06:45.170 --> 00:06:48.330
The corpse had no genetic anomalies.

00:06:48.900 --> 00:06:50.670
It was a false alarm.

00:06:51.270 --> 00:06:54.300
You can't tell if someone is a witch just by looking.

00:06:55.410 --> 00:06:58.070
I'm sure Sakaki couldn't have done anything.

00:06:58.480 --> 00:07:01.780
I've decided not to punish Sakaki this time.

00:07:02.350 --> 00:07:04.750
Also, about Robin's glasses...

00:07:07.390 --> 00:07:09.550
Why did you decide to meddle?

00:07:11.130 --> 00:07:13.320
You don't seem to understand what's at stake.

00:07:13.730 --> 00:07:18.860
From now on, you are to keep a close eye on all her actions.

00:07:21.770 --> 00:07:22.830
Understood.

00:07:24.440 --> 00:07:27.770
All I'm saying is that "sorry" isn't going to cut it this time!

00:07:28.240 --> 00:07:29.400
Are we clear?

00:07:30.450 --> 00:07:31.280
Yes, sir.

00:07:41.020 --> 00:07:42.180
Sakaki...

00:07:47.460 --> 00:07:49.120
What a load of crap!

00:07:55.100 --> 00:07:58.600
Hey, she was with him, so why isn't Dojima being chewed out?

00:07:59.080 --> 00:08:00.740
Ask her yourself.

00:08:01.140 --> 00:08:04.270
It's hard to ask something like that to somebody's face.

00:08:04.750 --> 00:08:06.510
It's because I'm special.

00:08:08.650 --> 00:08:10.620
My folks are real bigshots.

00:08:11.750 --> 00:08:15.710
They thought that the only option left for me is to join the STN.

00:08:16.930 --> 00:08:19.420
They begged Mr. Zaizen to let me join.

00:08:22.260 --> 00:08:24.370
Are you all right, Chief?

00:08:24.370 --> 00:08:26.700
Well, I don't have a fever...

00:08:27.300 --> 00:08:28.900
Maybe it's something like hay fever?

00:08:29.440 --> 00:08:30.230
Hey, I know!

00:08:30.740 --> 00:08:33.610
I heard you get better if you pass the bug to someone else.

00:08:40.380 --> 00:08:42.280
Something like this has happened before?

00:08:42.850 --> 00:08:47.790
About a year ago, Karasuma sensed the presence of a witch in the middle of town.

00:08:48.920 --> 00:08:53.880
I sensed the witch's thoughts in the crowd that was passing by.

00:08:54.760 --> 00:08:59.720
But I couldn't tell who the thoughts belonged to.

00:09:00.340 --> 00:09:02.610
And when Karasuma turned around,

00:09:02.610 --> 00:09:06.440
...one man suddenly started to run away as if he were terrified of something.

00:09:06.840 --> 00:09:10.070
But when we caught the man, it turned out that he wasn't a witch.

00:09:10.610 --> 00:09:14.410
He was just scared of something. So scared he couldn't even talk.

00:09:15.180 --> 00:09:19.380
He didn't even remember being chased by us.

00:09:19.690 --> 00:09:23.720
When it happened, I smelled what I thought was sweet olives...

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:26.350
Even though they were out of season.

00:09:26.800 --> 00:09:30.360
I don't know if it's the same thing that you smelled, Dojima.

00:09:31.100 --> 00:09:34.470
That was the smell of sweet olives, all right.

00:09:35.370 --> 00:09:36.900
I have fond memories of that smell...

00:09:37.570 --> 00:09:40.740
Memories of what, though, is a secret.

00:09:42.240 --> 00:09:43.770
Is it the same witch?

00:09:44.150 --> 00:09:46.180
I did some digging,

00:09:46.180 --> 00:09:49.980
but the two victims back then and now have nothing in common.

00:09:50.620 --> 00:09:53.110
If I had to guess, I'd say that that smell is the key.

00:09:53.490 --> 00:09:55.820
That alone doesn't give us any leads.

00:09:56.590 --> 00:09:57.290
But...

00:09:57.990 --> 00:10:00.890
Are you saying that you'll go sniffing around all over town?

00:10:02.900 --> 00:10:08.700
Amon, we got lucky when the man back then only suffered temporary amnesia.

00:10:09.510 --> 00:10:11.230
We have to avoid more false alarms.

00:10:13.980 --> 00:10:20.640
In both instances, that smell was completely gone by the time they got to the Factory.

00:10:21.080 --> 00:10:23.310
It's no good as data.

00:10:23.520 --> 00:10:27.750
For the time being, I'll try checking it against Solomon's database.

00:10:50.480 --> 00:10:52.740
What, you again?

00:10:52.920 --> 00:10:53.680
Yes, sir.

00:10:54.220 --> 00:10:56.240
Did you find the man you were looking for?

00:10:57.650 --> 00:10:58.620
No, sir.

00:10:58.620 --> 00:10:59.780
Let me have a look.

00:11:00.590 --> 00:11:04.150
You'd never guess it, but we have territories...

00:11:04.490 --> 00:11:06.260
...and a wide network of connections.

00:11:07.030 --> 00:11:09.430
Newcomers stand out like a sore thumb.

00:11:09.770 --> 00:11:11.530
Oh. Here.

00:11:15.300 --> 00:11:17.470
I haven't seen him around here.

00:11:18.610 --> 00:11:21.100
You should try the park up the road.

00:11:21.510 --> 00:11:24.250
I hear they get new people all the time.

00:11:24.250 --> 00:11:26.080
Thank you. I'll check it out.

00:11:31.550 --> 00:11:32.520
Welcome...

00:11:38.890 --> 00:11:42.090
Have you heard anything out of the ordinary from your people lately?

00:11:43.770 --> 00:11:45.670
What happened?

00:12:22.970 --> 00:12:27.430
Karasuma, can you remember anything else about what happened back then?

00:12:28.180 --> 00:12:30.680
I'm sure it was my mistake.

00:12:30.680 --> 00:12:33.520
But it's exactly the same as this latest case.

00:12:33.520 --> 00:12:35.640
This isn't a case, Robin.

00:12:36.220 --> 00:12:38.120
It's all just conjecture.

00:12:38.690 --> 00:12:41.250
We have no proof that there was a witch,

00:12:42.020 --> 00:12:45.960
and maybe the guy who ran away is completely unrelated.

00:12:46.330 --> 00:12:48.490
Yeah, but...

00:12:48.830 --> 00:12:51.600
It's almost as if you want something to happen.

00:12:52.470 --> 00:12:53.730
I'm not like that.

00:12:54.300 --> 00:12:56.570
I'm relieved on days when nothing happens.

00:12:59.170 --> 00:13:00.270
I just...

00:13:03.450 --> 00:13:04.910
It's all right. I'm sorry.

00:13:05.810 --> 00:13:07.540
I'm getting worked up over nothing.

00:13:07.950 --> 00:13:08.940
Michael.

00:13:09.690 --> 00:13:13.310
I'm turning up zilch. Not even Solomon has any data on smells.

00:13:13.660 --> 00:13:14.750
I'm not surprised.

00:13:15.920 --> 00:13:18.650
Do some digging on a witch called Single Eye.

00:13:19.130 --> 00:13:20.360
Single Eye?

00:13:22.200 --> 00:13:23.230
Dojima.

00:13:23.230 --> 00:13:24.200
Yes, sir?

00:13:24.500 --> 00:13:25.330
Where's Sakaki?

00:13:25.330 --> 00:13:27.600
He stepped out and hasn't checked in since!

00:13:27.970 --> 00:13:29.840
He isn't answering his cell phone, either.

00:13:30.870 --> 00:13:31.840
I see.

00:13:32.510 --> 00:13:36.240
This guy is a really rare type of witch!

00:13:36.850 --> 00:13:39.610
There have only been a few reported cases all over the world.

00:13:40.620 --> 00:13:43.420
To an outside observer, he doesn't do anything.

00:13:43.420 --> 00:13:45.410
He doesn't cause anything physical to happen.

00:13:46.660 --> 00:13:50.720
But this guy... he controls minds.

00:13:55.500 --> 00:13:59.230
Um, excuse me... Anyone home?

00:14:08.710 --> 00:14:12.740
He sends intense thought waves into other people's minds.

00:14:13.280 --> 00:14:16.880
Okay, I said "control," but he can't make people do anything he wants.

00:14:17.720 --> 00:14:19.850
He creeps into people's minds...

00:14:20.490 --> 00:14:22.250
...and implants terror.

00:14:24.690 --> 00:14:27.660
No way... Is that even possible?

00:14:28.030 --> 00:14:29.690
This is just a hypothesis,

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:35.200
but he just amplifies feelings of doubt and fear that were already in that person.

00:14:36.340 --> 00:14:37.270
Then...

00:14:37.270 --> 00:14:40.900
The greater your doubts and fears, the more danger you're in.

00:14:41.280 --> 00:14:43.080
This witch is tricky.

00:14:43.080 --> 00:14:46.380
There's no way to tell who is using this power.

00:14:46.820 --> 00:14:50.580
In a city crowd, it'll be impossible to pinpoint who the witch is.

00:14:53.620 --> 00:14:55.320
Mr. Amon! I need you here!

00:14:55.920 --> 00:14:58.790
There's a guy here with basically the same symptoms as the last one!

00:14:59.460 --> 00:15:02.260
He looks like he's terrified of something.

00:15:05.430 --> 00:15:07.430
All right. I'll be right there.

00:15:07.640 --> 00:15:10.970
Sakaki, keep an eye on him while provoking him as little as possible.

00:15:12.470 --> 00:15:14.530
I'm sending the rest of you somewhere else.

00:15:16.210 --> 00:15:18.200
See? No weapons.

00:15:19.180 --> 00:15:22.780
I'm not gonna do anything. So calm down, okay?

00:15:23.350 --> 00:15:24.580
You can do that, right?

00:15:36.370 --> 00:15:37.530
H-Hey!

00:15:38.670 --> 00:15:39.360
Crap!

00:15:51.650 --> 00:15:54.450
I don't get it. Why is he sending us back to the scene of the first incident?

00:15:54.450 --> 00:15:56.710
Over there! Stop right around there!

00:16:22.880 --> 00:16:25.850
Sakaki, this man is most likely a decoy.

00:16:25.850 --> 00:16:26.950
Huh?

00:16:26.950 --> 00:16:28.440
He lured you away.

00:16:29.180 --> 00:16:31.650
If the man in that first incident was a decoy as well,

00:16:32.150 --> 00:16:34.420
...there has to be something at that first location.

00:16:35.290 --> 00:16:37.260
Karasuma and the others are heading there now.

00:16:37.790 --> 00:16:38.890
Let's get going, too.

00:16:46.100 --> 00:16:48.070
Oops, sorry.

00:16:48.440 --> 00:16:52.370
I'm getting old, you see, and I can't see too well out of this eye.

00:16:52.370 --> 00:16:53.500
Forgive me.

00:16:55.140 --> 00:16:56.280
That's all right.

00:16:56.280 --> 00:16:57.440
Hey, over here!

00:17:02.680 --> 00:17:03.550
Huh?

00:17:05.120 --> 00:17:06.280
They're gone...

00:17:06.790 --> 00:17:07.810
No way!

00:17:08.090 --> 00:17:09.020
Dojima!

00:17:09.660 --> 00:17:11.850
Sakaki! The pictures, they're...

00:17:12.490 --> 00:17:14.930
I just got a call from Michael.

00:17:15.630 --> 00:17:17.830
They just found Takizawa's body. He'd drowned.

00:17:18.370 --> 00:17:21.140
Time of death was three days ago. It looks like suicide.

00:17:21.140 --> 00:17:22.170
You're joking!

00:17:22.170 --> 00:17:26.300
Then who have we been searching for?

00:17:27.010 --> 00:17:32.280
Did this witch ever exist in the first place?

00:17:34.150 --> 00:17:37.550
Have we just been getting jerked around all day?

00:17:40.520 --> 00:17:41.680
That smell...

00:17:44.630 --> 00:17:46.990
This is it! This is the smell!

00:18:17.930 --> 00:18:18.920
It's all right.

00:18:20.700 --> 00:18:23.060
Everything's all right.

00:18:43.750 --> 00:18:46.720
The smell... It's fading.

00:18:47.420 --> 00:18:48.680
I don't get it...

00:18:49.790 --> 00:18:52.520
There's no anger or rage here.

00:18:52.760 --> 00:18:56.630
Just despair and sadness deeper than I've ever felt.

00:18:57.570 --> 00:19:00.330
He's incredibly sad, that's all...

00:19:08.310 --> 00:19:15.740
My secret memory really isn't all that secret.

00:19:16.790 --> 00:19:21.150
When I was little, our garden had lots of sweet olive trees.

00:19:22.190 --> 00:19:27.720
I can barely remember my parents' faces, but I'll never forget that sweet smell.

00:19:30.130 --> 00:19:32.600
How much do you remember of your family?

00:19:33.300 --> 00:19:37.200
I don't have parents, so...

00:19:39.640 --> 00:19:41.200
You're lucky.

00:19:51.250 --> 00:19:54.220
Amon, where are you?

00:19:54.220 --> 00:19:57.120
I'm sorry... I came home.

00:19:57.660 --> 00:19:59.720
Ignore that last phone call.

00:20:00.260 --> 00:20:03.600
It just seems like you're exhausted, somehow.

00:20:04.300 --> 00:20:05.930
Well, I'll see you later.

00:20:16.010 --> 00:20:17.540
Oh, welcome.

00:20:18.480 --> 00:20:19.470
Good evening.

00:20:21.550 --> 00:20:22.920
An espresso?

00:20:23.050 --> 00:20:25.020
Yes, please.

00:20:42.600 --> 00:20:43.660
I have my own.

00:20:48.380 --> 00:20:50.570
Can I ask one thing?

00:20:51.410 --> 00:20:52.400
Go ahead.

00:20:52.810 --> 00:20:59.080
Amon, did you think that the culprit would come back for the pictures of his family?

00:20:59.820 --> 00:21:02.590
Yes, although I don't understand why he would be...

00:21:02.590 --> 00:21:05.060
...so obsessed with such things that he'd risk himself.

00:21:05.660 --> 00:21:07.000
Amon, do you have...

00:21:07.000 --> 00:21:07.890
No.

00:21:08.960 --> 00:21:11.060
I don't have a family.

00:21:14.200 --> 00:21:15.330
Me, neither.

00:21:15.670 --> 00:21:17.190
One last question.

00:21:17.510 --> 00:21:22.040
How did you know that the smell belonged to a witch called Single Eye?

00:21:22.040 --> 00:21:26.240
It was just a rumor. I didn't have any hard evidence.

00:21:26.850 --> 00:21:30.220
And the person who told me that rumor is this man here.

00:21:35.660 --> 00:21:38.320
It's just something that I heard once.

00:21:39.030 --> 00:21:44.730
That when that witch uses his powers, the only trace he leaves is a smell.

00:21:47.000 --> 00:21:48.670
And one more thing.

00:21:48.670 --> 00:21:52.370
"Single Eye" means just that. He only has one eye.

00:21:52.670 --> 00:21:53.640
He has one eye?

00:21:53.640 --> 00:21:56.840
No, he has two eyes, all right.

00:21:57.510 --> 00:22:01.070
But one eye is just for show. He can barely see out of it.

00:22:07.190 --> 00:22:09.020
That man, was he...

00:22:36.820 --> 00:22:44.810
Just how far back do I need to go?

00:22:44.630 --> 00:22:47.670
Tell me.

00:22:48.880 --> 00:22:59.660
It's all so vivid that it hurts.

00:23:00.520 --> 00:23:09.550
The truth is, nothing can be shared,

00:23:09.230 --> 00:23:14.040
...so I never looked back.

00:23:15.310 --> 00:23:19.410
...all those promises...

00:23:21.350 --> 00:23:25.810
...inside me eventually...

00:23:25.100 --> 00:23:31.610
...gave up on that light from some other time,

00:23:30.810 --> 00:23:40.390
...like the light of a morning you can't return to.
